include:
========

This directory contains two subdirectories: 'objc' for the foundation
classes, and 'apps' for applications that user's create.  Feel free
to add your own.  These directories contain the @interface .h files.
Under UN*X systems, the Amiga header files should be stored here.
The 'mustinit.ooc' file is used by the prelinker, and the path here
is compiled into 'prelink' (source file src/xlator/pln.c).

--- brian witt, 18-April-90
